            "text": "{\n  \"candidates\": [\n    {\n      \"content\": {\n        \"parts\": [\n          {\n            \"text\": \"1. The quiet cabin sat in the violet meadow, bathed in the golden shadow of a silver planet. A simple lantern rested on the narrow table, its yellow candle flickering near a cotton ribbon. Outside the window, a rapid falcon soared over the timber bridge and the hollow stone garden. The winter forest echoed with gentle music, while a copper anchor lay forgotten in the harbor. A purple canvas square marked the quiet island, catching the orange signal from a distant rocket engine.\\n\\n2. A simple paper letter lay on the marble table, detailing a story of a hidden island harbor. The orange feather rested beside a violet candle, casting a quiet shadow across the copper mirror. In the narrow winter valley, a silver helmet and a golden saddle were left near the timber bridge. The gentle river reflected the yellow lantern, while a rapid thunder shook the maple forest. A purple rocket engine waited in the hollow corner, ready for its rapid orbit.\\n\\n3. The golden market in the narrow forest valley offered a canvas basket filled with simple orange cotton. A silver falcon watched from a maple branch, its shadow falling on the quiet stone field. A purple ribbon and a yellow feather blew across the quiet meadow, landing near a copper helmet. The winter island was a simple garden of hollow timber and marble rock. A gentle signal came from the rocket orbit, bringing music to the quiet river and harbor bridge.\\n\\n4. A violet canvas window framed the simple winter forest, where a narrow bridge crossed the gentle river. The golden lantern illuminated the table, revealing a yellow candle and a copper pocket mirror. A rapid falcon circled the marble island, as thunder rolled over the quiet meadow garden. The silver rocket engine sat in the hollow corner of the market, a quiet anchor for the paper signal. A maple basket and a purple ribbon rested gently by the stone harbor ladder.\\n\\n5. The narrow timber ladder led to a quiet cabin window, overlooking the purple valley and silver bridge. A golden saddle and a simple copper helmet lay in the shadow of a large maple tree. The market field was quiet, lit only by a yellow lantern and a gently glowing candle. A rapid orbit of a distant planet sent a signal to the island harbor. A violet feather fell onto the marble canvas, accompanied by the gentle music of winter thunder.\\n\\n6. In the golden shadow of the winter forest, a quiet maple cabin stood near the rapid river. A purple canvas basket held a simple silver mirror and a yellow paper letter. The gentle meadow was marked by a narrow stone path leading to the island harbor. A copper rocket engine and a violet helmet rested in the quiet corner. The planet orbit brought a simple signal, while a falcon dropped a cotton feather onto the hollow wooden timber table.\\n\\n7. The silver anchor lay in the rapid river, near the gentle shadow of the narrow timber bridge. A yellow lantern glowed in the quiet window, lighting up a purple ribbon and a cotton canvas. The winter meadow was a simple golden garden, echoing with the music of distant thunder. A copper rocket waited in the hollow island market, ready to orbit the violet planet. The story of the falcon was written on a paper square, resting on a marble table.\\n\\n8. A narrow violet ribbon tied the yellow paper letter, which told a simple story of the forest. The golden basket sat on the marble table, holding a copper candle and a silver pocket mirror. A gentle falcon flew over the hollow valley, its shadow passing the timber cabin window. The rapid river flowed past the island harbor, where a stone anchor lay quiet. The rocket engine signaled the start of a winter orbit, illuminating the planet and the meadow.\\n\\n9. The quiet market corner displayed a silver helmet, a purple canvas saddle, and a simple orange basket. A golden lantern cast a narrow shadow across the marble bridge and the gentle winter meadow. The hollow timber cabin held a yellow candle and a paper letter regarding the rocket orbit. A rapid falcon circled the copper island, while thunder roared over the maple forest. The signal brought music to the quiet valley, as a violet feather drifted onto the table.\\n\\n10. A purple planet hung in the winter sky, casting a golden shadow over the narrow river bridge. The quiet cabin in the hollow forest housed a copper lantern and a simple silver mirror. A yellow cotton ribbon lay on the marble table next to a paper story. The rapid market was quiet, holding only a violet basket and a timber ladder. A gentle rocket engine sat by the harbor, while an orange feather fluttered near the stone anchor.\\n\\n11. The gentle winter wind blew a yellow feather across the narrow timber bridge in the quiet valley. A purple canvas saddle and a silver helmet rested in the shadow of the hollow maple tree. The island harbor was calm, lit by a golden candle and a copper lantern. A rapid rocket engine prepared for orbit, sending a simple signal across the marble forest. The story of the planet was sung to quiet music, echoing over the simple stone field.\\n\\n12. A silver pocket mirror caught the orange light of the yellow candle on the narrow marble table. The violet meadow surrounded the quiet timber cabin, where a simple canvas basket sat empty. A golden falcon flew past the forest window, heading toward the rapid river and stone harbor. The winter thunder broke the gentle silence, signaling the rocket in its hollow orbit. A copper ribbon marked the paper letter, telling a story of the quiet island and maple bridge.\\n\\n13. The narrow bridge over the rapid river led to a quiet winter market in the maple valley. A golden basket held a simple orange lantern, a purple ribbon, and a silver pocket watch. The gentle shadow of a falcon fell across the hollow timber cabin and its canvas window. A copper rocket engine awaited its orbit around 